	(descr "Six back-side solder lands for the panel cable: 1 GND, 2 +5V, 3 A6, 4 A7, 5 D7, 6 D8. Pad 1 marked by a silk arrow. Direct-solder rather than a connector, because JST-XH is through-hole and this board puts no hole through its front face. Strain relief is provided by the chassis, not the board.")
